@host = http://localhost:5180

### Queue a job (copy the id from the response)
POST {{host}}/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "prompt": "List the files in this directory and say in one sentence what the project is." }

### All jobs, newest first
GET {{host}}/jobs

### One job
@id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{host}}/jobs/{{id}}

### Cancel it
DELETE {{host}}/jobs/{{id}}
